regression/sem_close-unmap ends by falling off the end of main, which
returns 0 only from a function named main. build.sh renames each test's
main, so the test returned what was left in a register, and Clang, free
to choose, returned 1: it now returns 0 itself, as the other tests
return t_status. Radix's alone.

--- a/src/regression/sem_close-unmap.c
+++ b/src/regression/sem_close-unmap.c
@@ -16,4 +16,5 @@
 	sem_close(sem);
 	// semaphore should be still mapped
 	sem_post(sem);
+	return 0;
 }
